  └── inspect_environment()

execute concurrently

collect results

send combined result back to model
```
Add dependency-aware execution so independent calls can run simultaneously while dependent calls wait.  
Implement:  
```
ToolCallGraph
ToolExecutionQueue
ToolResultStore
```
with cancellation support.  
   
