## 23. Model Context / Tool Context Management  
Add a context manager that tracks:  
```
system instructions
conversation
tool calls
tool outputs
files
shell output
project metadata
model metadata
```
Prevent enormous tool outputs from consuming the entire context window.  
Implement:  
* output truncation  
* summarization  
* relevant-result extraction  
* tool-result caching  
* deduplication  
* context budgeting  
Large files should never automatically be dumped into the model context.  
   
⸻  
   
## 24. Tool Result Caching  
Add optional caching.  
For deterministic read-only operations:  
```
git_status
project_tree
file_search
system_info
documentation lookup
```
cache results for a configurable amount of time.  
Never cache mutable/destructive operations as if they were successful.  
   
⸻  
   
## 25. Tool Error Recovery  
Models should be able to recover from tool failures.  
Example:  
```
Tool call
   ↓
Failure
   ↓
Structured error
   ↓
Model sees error
   ↓
Model changes arguments/strategy
   ↓
Retry
```
Implement retry limits and prevent infinite tool loops.  
Add configurable:  
```
max_tool_calls
max_parallel_calls
max_retries
max_execution_time
max_context_growth
```
   
⸻  
   
## 26. Agent Loop  
Create a robust agent execution loop:  
```
USER
 ↓
MODEL
 ↓
TOOL DECISION
 ↓
VALIDATE
 ↓
PERMISSION
 ↓
EXECUTE
 ↓
RESULT
 ↓
MODEL
 ↓
...
 ↓
FINAL RESPONSE
```
Support:  
* multiple sequential calls  
* parallel calls  
* retries  
* cancellation  
* timeouts  
* tool dependencies  
* permission prompts  
* structured errors  
The loop must terminate deterministically.  
   
⸻  
   
